OL,3,ABystander 'heroically intervened' after
OL,4,Athree children and teacher killed in US
OL,5,Aschool shooting
OL,6,
OL,7,FOregon Governor Tina Kotek has praised
OL,8,Fa bystander who "heroically intervened"
OL,9,Fto stop a shooting at a primary school
OL,11,FKotek added that lives have been
OL,12,F"forever changed" after four people -
OL,13,Fincluding a teacher and children aged
OL,14,Ffive, eight and 11- were killed in a
OL,15,Fshooting at Silver Rail Elementary
OL,16,FSchool in Bend on Thursday
OL,18,FPolice responded after receiving a call
OL,19,Fthat an armed person had fired at a car
OL,20,Fbefore he was seen going into the
OL,21,Fschool with a long gun
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
