OL,3,ABystander 'heroically intervened' after
OL,4,Athree children and teacher killed in US
OL,5,Aschool shooting
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe attacker, a 16-year-old boy, was
OL,8,Fshot dead by a community member who
OL,9,F"pursued him into the school", Bend
OL,10,FPolice Chief Mike Krantz says
OL,12,FTwo additional victims, a
OL,13,Fseven-year-old and a 54-year-old
OL,14,Fteacher, were taken to hospital in a
OL,15,Fcritical condition
OL,17,FSchools in the district will remain
OL,18,Fclosed today "due to the tragedy",
OL,19,Fofficials say
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
